2026-03-15T18:56:20.994Z [INFO] Custom agent "fractal-factory-domain-scanner" invoked with prompt: Scan the domain brief and invariants document to produce the initial domain model for the **romantic-fantasy-writer** agent family.

## Inputs
- `.fractal-factory/domain-brief.md` — 415-line domain brief covering genre focus, input types, architecture requirements, pipeline phases
- `.fractal-factory/invariants.md` — invariants and craft toolbox document  
- `.fractal-factory/context.json` — pipeline configuration (maxDepth: 4, maxAgents: 80, maxGapCycles: 10)

## Output
Write the initial domain model to `.fractal-factory/domain-model.json`.

Write your status to `.fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-domain-scanner/status.json` using the standard status contract:
```json
{
  "agent": "fractal-factory-domain-scanner",
  "task_id": "pass1/scan",
  "status": "completed",
  "result": "scanned",
  "summary": "...",
  "artifacts": ["domain-model.json", "agents/fractal-factory-domain-scanner/status.json"],
  "next_hint": "fractal-factory-invariant-extractor",
  "iteration": 1
}
```

If the domain brief is missing or too sparse to produce a meaningful domain model, use result: "insufficient-input" instead.

All paths are relative to `.fractal-factory/`.
